          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2y^2}{3}&=5\\\\2y^2&=15\\\\y^2&=\\frac{15}{2}\\\\y&=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
