          "short": "$x=10\\pm2\\sqrt{5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3(x-10)^2}{5}&=12\\\\3(x-10)^2&=60\\\\(x-10)^2&=20\\\\x-10&=\\pm2\\sqrt{5}\\\\x&=10\\pm2\\sqrt{5}\\end{align*}$$",
