        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=4\\pm\\sqrt{13}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y^2-8y&=-3\\\\y^2-8y+16&=-3+16\\\\(y-4)^2&=13\\\\y-4&=\\pm\\sqrt{13}\\\\y&=4\\pm\\sqrt{13}\\end{align*}$$",
