        "answer": {
          "short": "$m=\\dfrac{1\\pm\\sqrt{5}}{2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m^2-m&=1\\\\m^2-m+\\frac14&=1+\\frac14\\\\\\left(m-\\frac12\\right)^2&=\\frac54\\\\m-\\frac12&=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\\\m&=\\frac{1\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
